│ ❯ Q1  Where should a session's full transcript, every tool result and each compaction summary be kept once a run ends?   │
│       Include the archived sessions, the tool_result records and the full 日本語 transcript, not just the latest entry.  │
│       Assume the developer will often be offline and needs to carry this between machines without losing any run         │
│       history.                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                          │
│ A ○ SQLite in the repository, beside the worktrees                Preview                                                │
│     One file the checkout can delete, and no service to keep      ```sql                                                 │
│     running on any of the machines. Copy it together with the …     create table if not exists event (                   │
│ B ○ Postgres beside the application, shared by every machine          id integer primary key,                            │
