│     laptop that is often offline.                                     at text not null,                                  │
│ C ○ Keep a local log beside each checkout and merge later             body json not null                                 │
│     Works offline without setting up a server, but syncing a        ) strict;                                            │
│     single run can produce duplicate records.                     ```                                                    │
│ D ○ Mirror sessions to an append-only archive as they finish                                                             │
